es hard to press the button when  you have the perfect pose or stand  further from the camera this is why this  little hack is really useful you can use  the volume to take a picture and the  best thing about this is that you can do  it by using the headphones cord to it is  also fun to know that you can still take  a picture even when you are filming a  video with these new settings we're  pretty sure that you are going to be the  one who takes the best selfies on  Instagram  the call have you ever been wondering  why you can accept or decline a call and  then you can only swipe to answer iPhone  users had many theories to explain this  difference some of them think that it  depends on who is calling or which phone  they are using but the answer is  actually really simple when your phone  is locked you can only slide to answer  but if you are already using it you have  the option to accept or decline who knew  that it was this simple are there any  other secret phone settings that you  know don't be shy to tell us what it is  in the comment section down below we  love to hear what you think and that's  it for tech news secret phone settings  that will surprise you for more stories  like this make sure you watch fifteen  ways the Internet has changed your life  thanks for watching  [Music]

